# docs/28 §3.2 (D11, S1a): the plug-in hint. Two memos recorded away from any Mac; plugged
# into the work Mac, the hint bar says so for 5 s while those two are held back. Tab asks,
# Enter keeps them from this Mac (2 presses); doing nothing gives them to it (0 presses).
# Run with --lang en for the English screens.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include home_mac.cpas
press opt+h
usb off
wait 1500
include memo.cpas
include memo.cpas
shot offline  two memos recorded offline: 录2 on the status bar
usb on
include work_mac.cpas
wait 300
shot hint  plugged into the work Mac: 离线 2 条 → 这台 · Tab 不给 (held 5 s)
press tab
shot ask  Tab: the hint asks (not the Tab menu); Enter keeps them from this Mac
press enter
wait 300
shot held  Enter: 已不给这台 Mac：2 条; the work Mac never lists them
wait 6000
pull
shot after  after 6 s and a pull: still 录2 (they wait for the home Mac)
usb off
wait 1500
usb on
include home_mac.cpas
wait 6000
pull
press opt+m
press ,
shot home  the home Mac took them: 设置 → 存储 says 2 kept, the batch now its ·XXXX
